  "name": "OGC API - Processes - Part 2 Building Blocks",
  "abstract": "Building blocks for OGC API - Processes - Part 2: Deploy, Replace, Undeploy (DRU),\nwith canonical single-or-array executionUnitValue and legacy flat executionUnit.\n",
  "description": "This repository contains building blocks for OGC API - Processes - Part 2 extending \nthe core OGC API - Processes with process lifecycle management capabilities.\n\nBuilding blocks include schemas for:\n- OGC Application Package (ogcapppkg) - JSON format for describing deployable processes\n- CWL Encoding for OGC Application Package (ogcapppkg-cwl) - CWL encoding of the OGC Application Package\n- Execution Unit Property Value (executionUnitValue) - Canonical single unit or array\n- Execution Unit Base (executionUnitBase) - Link or qualified container, CWL or custom unit\n- Execution Unit Container (executionUnitContainer) - Nested container payload\n- Input Binding (inputBinding) and Output Binding (outputBinding) - Container bindings\n- Execution Unit (executionUnit) - Preserved legacy flat container contract\n- Static indicator schema (staticIndicator) - Process summary with mutability indicator\n",
